Modifications
-------------
The extension source code (opencli-extension-v1.0.17-edge.zip) has been
modified from the original Chrome extension for Edge compatibility.
Suspected changes (not all individually verified):

  - `AbortSignal.timeout()` → `AbortController` fallback
  - `tabGroups` color `orange` → `yellow` (Edge doesn't support
    `orange` as a group color)
  - `debugger.getTargets()`: added callback→Promise shim
  - `TAB_GROUP_ID_NONE`: replaced with `-1`
  - `Runtime.evaluate` return: added `?.` safe access
  - All CDP commands: wrapped with callback→Promise shim

These changes are specific to the bundled archive; the upstream
OpenCLI project at https://github.com/jackwener/OpenCLI remains
unmodified and continues to target Chrome only.

